{"id":1010301,"name":"라후·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"라후·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010301]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10301,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2023-10-27 14:00:00","diary1":"며칠 전 FAC의 특수 부대 작전 유닛 수감자 라후가 MBCC로 발령되었다.\n　　그녀와 함께 온 것은 이제껏 한 번도 보지 못한 어떤 조직의 필체가 담긴 인사이동 명령 문서뿐이었다. 당신이 유일하게 알게 된 사실은 이 명령을 내린 사람이 상상 초월의 권력을 가지고 있고, 알려지지 않은 목적이 있다는 것이었다.\n　　당신은 반드시 이에 대응해야 했다.","diary2":"라후의 목적이 무엇이든, 콘래드·케이지를 대하는 그녀의 태도가 어딘가 부자연스러웠다.\n　　콘래드·케이지와의 면회는 라후 배후의 진실을 파악할 열쇠였다.","evidence":[{"ID":260433,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260434,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":7,"dialogue_id":110301001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110301020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":16,"dialogue_id":110301021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":1,"dialogue_id":110301022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogu